a=Text("The two main driving routes to Madikeri are the Mysuru–Hunsur–Kushalnagar route and the Hassan–Kushalnagar route. The Mysuru route is the most commonly recommended and generally the most convenient for first-time travelers, while the Hassan route is usually a good alternative when you want to avoid the Mysuru corridor.","h2")
